'''Type of feat''': [[class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[archmage]] level 1

'''Specifics''': The archmage who selects this type of [[high arcana]] can permanently prepare one of her [[arcane]] spells as a [[spell-like ability]] that can be used twice per day.  The spell-like ability normally uses a [[spell slot]] of the spell's level, although the archmage can choose to make a spell modified by a [[metamagic]] feat into a spell-like ability at the appropriate [[spell level]]. 

'''Use''': selected

==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

